window.products.push({"id":213065,"name":"Screwpull Travel Corkscrew and Foil Cutter Gift Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FLoYP4kmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Travel Corkscrew and Foilcutter Gift Set Amazon.com Just as there's nothing better than a bottle of wine at the beach, cabin, or campground, there's nothing worse than being stuck without a corkscrew. This travel corkscrew and foil cutter gift set from Screwpull is not only compact and lightweight, it's a sophisticated tool set friends will covet. Not only does it take the work out of cork removal for effortless bottle opening, it now automatically twists the cork off the screw. To open, simply pull the handle and the durable Teflon screw drives into the cork's center. Push the other way and the corkscrew slides the cork out effortlessly. Then, while holding the corkscrew panels (and not the cork), pull the handle again and voila--the device pushes the cork off the screw unscathed! Pinch down on the sides to keep the cork from falling off onto the ground. Reinsert the cork with the same ease, fold up the travel corkscrew and pack it away. The new Trilogy Foilcutter in this set features a patented, 4-wheel cutter design that cuts quickly and cleanly. Soft-touch panels ensure an easy grip, while razor-sharp cutters slice their way around with effortless twisting. It also doubles as a stand for the corkscrew. Designed in Europe and engineered using with highest quality materials for strength and durability, Screwpull's new Trilogy line also features luxurious, soft-touch panels for extra comfort. Non-stick coating and perfectly shaped points ensure frictionless opening. Plus, this innovative new line of Trilogy corkscrews and bottle-opening accessories was awarded the 2004 Cooking Club of America Kitchen Tested Seal of Approval from Cooking Pleasures magazine. Covered by a 5-year warranty, this handy device will stay sharp and cut smoothly for years. --Brian Olson","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41FLoYP4kmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Screwpull","source_asin":"B0006590BE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006590BE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006590BE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
