window.products.push({"id":213074,"name":"Sauder Misc Storage Contemporary 3-Shelf Wood Bookcase in Vintage Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":217.23,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418fxb34BTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Kick clutter and chaos to the curb! Give your home the additional storage space it needs while adding the style that you love with this 3-shelf bookcase from the Sauder Select collection. This storage bookcase features three large shelves that are ideal for storing a variety of different household items like your favorite books, stacks of magazines and work supplies. These spacious shelves also make a great spot to display home décor items like your collection of knick-knacks, decorative succulents, and framed photos of your family and friends. The two adjustable shelves have the ability to move to different heights to create flexible storage for items of all shapes and sizes. This small bookcase also offers a large top surface that provides you with additional space to store or display other items. Its versatile design and modern style make this bookcase a great solution for any room in your home. Finished in Vintage Oak, this display bookcase is everything you need and more!Features :- Finish: Vintage Oak- Material: Engineered Wood- Features Three (3) large shelves that offer the ideal amount of space to stow household items like your collection of novels, stacks of work folders and organizing bins- Two (2) shelves are adjustable to move to different heights to create flexible storage for items of all shapes and sizes- Versatile design and charming good looks- A large top surface that provides you with additional space for storage and display- Quick and easy assembly with patented slide-on moldings to save you time- Detailed instruction book for easy assembly.Specifications :- Product Weight : 61 lbs- Number of Shelves : 3- Assembly Required : Yes- Product Dimensions : 43.78\" H x 35.28\" W x 13.23\" D- Weight Capacity : 25 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/418fxb34BTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B085VV7GZR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213074","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085VV7GZR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085VV7GZR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
