window.products.push({"id":213446,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness Mis Quince Anos - Quinceanera Sweet 15 Birthday Party Round Candy Sticker Favors - Labels Fit Chocolate Candy (1 Sheet of 108)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FfsyjwNHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mis Quince Anos Round Candy Favor Labels INCLUDES 108 round candy stickers – perfect for styling adorable sweet 15 birthday party candy favors. Round candy labels will fit a variety of small candies with a flat, round bottom, such as chocolate Hershey’s Kisses, wrapped peppermints or gold-wrapped caramel candies. Mis Quince Anos small, round candy stickers MEASURE .75 inches diameter and will quickly add a personal touch to all your sweet treats at the party. EASY PARTY DECORATIONS: Mis Quince Anos round candy sticker labels are an easy party decoration to add to your list of party supplies. Scatter decorated candies down your dining tables, package in small gift bags as a party favor or display in a pretty bowl at your candy buffet. Get creative with your Ramos De Quinceanera DIY birthday party decoration ideas! PREMIUM PARTY SUPPLIES: Mis Quince Anos round candy labels are professionally printed on sticker paper with a photo-like shine. They are individually inspected and carefully packaged by hand. Simply attach each round candy sticker to your chosen candies. MADE IN THE USA: Mis Quince Anos - Quinceanera Sweet 15 Birthday Party Round Candy Sticker Favors are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. Please Note: Candies are not included but are available at your local grocery store. Sweet 15 Candy Stickers use a No-Mess Glitter Print: Our stickers are designed with a printed image of glitter, eliminating glitter flake while maximizing bling effect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FfsyjwNHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B07S2CXP9X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S2CXP9X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S2CXP9X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213447,"name":"HOMES: Inside + Out Aragon 7 Piece Formal Dining Table Set, Cherry","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":3985.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814emLf6ILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ornate and sophisticated, the Aragon 7-Piece Dining Table Set brings out the chic elegance of your formal dining room. Intricate carvings adorn the apron and dual pedestals for an eye-catching appearance. A center support beam connects both pedestals to ensure extra stability. The coordinating chairs each feature padded fabric-upholstered seats and elaborate carvings along the rounded backrests and down each leg for even more visual appeal. This table set includes two arm chairs, four side chairs and a dining table—all available in your choice of two colors. Product frame is constructed from solid wood and wood veneers. Wipe clean with a damp cloth. Assembly required. Product made in China. Once assembled, table with leaf measures 30.5 inches high by 112 inches wide by 46 inches deep; table without leaf measures 30.5 inches high by 76 inches wide by 46 inches deep; Side chair measures 45 inches high by 22 inches wide by 27.75 inches deep; Arm chair measures 45 inches high by 27.5 inches wide by 27.75 inches deep; 30-days hassle-free replacement parts warranty. Pictures are for illustration purposes. All décor items are not included in this offer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814emLf6ILL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMES","source_asin":"B082TNF1WD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213447","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082TNF1WD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082TNF1WD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
