window.products.push({"id":213508,"name":"PSDY Chair and Bar Stool Swivel Plate, Race Nylon Ring Bearings for Long Lasting Durability","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qt5cpbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Did your old steel bearing swivel plate wear out on your bar stool? Why go back to steel bearings, then? Upgrade your bar stool or chair swivel plate today with these 7\" swivel plates, made with full race nylon bearings that'll last almost forever this swivel plate is smoother, quieter, longer lasting, and can withstand some serious use long lasting durability has been tested by spinning these 500,000 times under a load of 500 lbs. That's half a million full spins not only are these extremely durable, they are also smooth. They glide quietly and smoothly due to the full race nylon bearings. This means no noisy, bouncy steel bearings that need to be lubricated and will eventually rust out these are maintenance free for years of use. Whatever the purpose, this swivel plate is the one you have been looking for. Built to last, non-maintenance, smooth and gliding, and high quality, this will make your chair or barstool like new again. The slotted mounting holes are on 5-1/2\" centers, and the plate itself if 3/4\" tall and 7\" square. The slotted mounting holes are oval and will accommodate most 5\" to 6\" mounting hole patterns. These may be difficult to rotate by hand before installation or putting weight on them. However, they will spin smoothly and easily with weight. Test for yourself with caution by putting weight on it and spinning it. This is because they are designed to spin with weight. Mounting hardware is not included with this swivel plate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+qt5cpbpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PSDY","source_asin":"B01F97DFMI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F97DFMI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F97DFMI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213509,"name":"Luna Removable Duvet Cover for Weighted Blanket - 48x72 - Full Size - Oeko-Tex Cooling Cotton - Machine Washable & 8 Ties for Secure Fastening - Desig","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lqpjKZ2qL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Bringing cloud-like, breathable cotton and deep, rich sleep, the Luna Adult Breathable Cotton Weighted Blanket is the perfect addition to your bed. The lightweight cotton design is blended with superior Deep Pressure Touch beads. The weight is intended to provide sensational comfort to help you fall asleep faster and stay asleep longer. Our body's biochemistry responds to the pressure to release serotonin, increase melatonin, and reduce cortisol (the stress hormone). Adapt to the weight in stages for optimal comfort, starting with covering your legs a few nights before moving up to your torso and finally to where you normally cover yourself with blankets. Made with OEKO-TEX certified cotton and layered construction with internal air channels to support air circulation and comfortable sleeping temperatures. The beads inside are glass beads, sewn into the fibers to reduce shifting and allow for even, non-bunchy weight distribution. Engineered and designed to be machine-washable, this blanket is easily cleanable and ready for more nights of deep, refreshing sleep. Finally celebrate a good night of peaceful sleep with the Luna Adult Breathable Cotton Weighted Blanket. Luna Removable Duvet Cover for Weighted Blanket - 48x72 - Full Size - Oeko-Tex Cooling Cotton - Machine Washable & 8 Ties for Secure Fastening - Designed in USA - Quatrefoil Silver - Grey","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lqpjKZ2qL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luna","source_asin":"B0BSSKD59R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSSKD59R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSSKD59R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
