window.products.push({"id":213598,"name":"ProPik 4 Pcs Christmas Ornament Storage Boxes with Dividers, Transparent Top, Zipper Closure & Handles- 4 Individual Ornament Holder Trays- Keeps 64 H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EQeKZ5q1L._AC_SL1184_.jpg","description":"Christmas Ornament Storage Box with Dividers, which is made to store, protect and organize your collection! Whether it's homemade ornaments and classic bulbs or sentimental figurines, nothing compares to decorating the Christmas tree. There's no doubt that ornaments are some of our most treasured possessions, whether they're sentimental pieces handed down from generations or created by hand. Since ornaments are typically displayed only during the holiday season, storing them during the rest of the year is important. Therefore, you will need a Christmas ornament box of such high quality that will keep your ornaments neatly organized and protected at all times. Each of these ornament boxes for storage is well-designed with a strong, protective exterior that protects the contents inside. To keep things even neater, they feature individual cardboard compartments! WHY CHOOSE US? Superior quality boxes Superior quality boxes Expertly crafted Expertly crafted Features finest quality material Features finest quality material Pack of 4 Individual Ornaments Boxes Pack of 4 Individual Ornaments Boxes Stores up to 64 ornaments Stores up to 64 ornaments An elegant design An elegant design Features cardboard dividers Features cardboard dividers Brings comfort and style Brings comfort and style Safe, smooth and sturdy Safe, smooth and sturdy Durable and long- lasting Durable and long- lasting Protects them from bumps, scratches, and dents Protects them from bumps, scratches, and dents Features a transparent top Features a transparent top Makes it easy to identify the content inside Makes it easy to identify the content inside Secure zipper closure Secure zipper closure Prevents dust and dirt Prevents dust and dirt Sturdy handles on either side Sturdy handles on either side Easy to carry and store Easy to carry and store Guaranteed Satisfaction Guaranteed Satisfaction A thing of joy to have and to behold, PACKAGE INCLUDES 4 X Christmas Ornaments Storage Boxes DIMENSIONS – 12.9-inch L X 12.9-inch W X 3.1-inch H So, what are you waiting for? ADD this Christmas Ornament Box Storage to your basket and get ready to protect your pride in style!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71EQeKZ5q1L._AC_SL1184_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ProPik","source_asin":"B0BQP6M8ST","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQP6M8ST","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQP6M8ST","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
