window.products.push({"id":213600,"name":"The Buffalo Soldiers Poster by Sankofa Designs (19x13 inches - Black Frame)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uXegL5TbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A framed historical poster that pays tribute to the legacy of the Buffalo Soldiers. Those members of the 9th and 10th Calvary remembered for their fierce fighting ability. This poster features images of of many different Buffalo Soldiers and words describing where the name 'Buffalo Soldiers' came from. “The nickname, 'Buffalo Soldiers' began with the Cheyenne warriors in 1867. The actual Cheyenne translation was 'Wild Buffalo'. The nickname was given out of respect and because of the fierce fighting ability of the 10th Calvary. Over time, 'Buffalo Soldiers' became a generic term for all African-American soldiers.\". This work of art measures 17 inches x 11 inches (paper size) and 17 inches x 11 inches (image size). It is printed on high-quality glossy paper with a weight of 230 GSM. A beautiful historical poster meant to motivate, educate and inspire. Get one for your home, school, church or office today! Unframed Poster: 17x11 inches (image size) - 17x11 inches (poster size) Framed Poster: 19x13 inches (framed size) - 17x11 inches (poster size) \"We are going to emancipate ourselves from mental slavery because whilst others might free the body, none but ourselves can free the mind.\" - Marcus Garvey","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81uXegL5TbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Art Depot","source_asin":"B0841P2V6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213600","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0841P2V6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0841P2V6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
