window.products.push({"id":213613,"name":"Closet Organizer and Shelf Divider Separator| Organization Storage for Home, Clothing, Books, and Kitchen Appliances | Pack of 4 or 6, Simple Sleek Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S0xRqCLeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Need help tidying up? Allow us to present the easiest and most effective home organization solution to decluttering your space! Organize, separate and de-clutter virtually any space with our durable iron closet, shelf, and kitchen organizer! Virtually any closet shelf storage space that needs organization needs the Nessentials Shelf Organizers! Let your shelves and cabinets speak for themselves, while we help you organize in style! Use for a Variety of Spaces These organizers are great for spaces such as: clothing, linen closets, cabinets, bathrooms, kitchens, office , garage or bookshelves! Made for the Minimalist The sleek and simplistic design allows for a seamless look. Proudly display anything you are organizing, without the bulky interruption that other closet organizers and storage brands may offer. Versatile and Adjustable These closet dividers are fully adjustable, made for standard shelving from 0.5 to 1 inch thick, so you can trust that they will fit perfectly for whatever space you want to re-arrange! They also come complete with flexible and durable hooks with rubber feet at the ends, so you can trust that your furniture will be protected and damage-free! Super Simple Installation Our no-fuss installation process makes our shelf dividers for closets even ideal for those with limited space, or anyone that needs a non-permanent and non-damaging solution to clutter! Excellence in Customer Service We are confident that you will be fully 100% satisfied with your purchase. However, if you are not for whatever reason, Nessentials customer service is ready to help! What You’ll Receive: 4 or 6 Sleek metal organizing dividers with adjustable hook and rubber feet attached De-Clutter your Kitchen, Closet, Bathroom, and more with the Nessentials Multi-Use Organizers and Dividers! Click 'Add to Cart' and purchase yours today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S0xRqCLeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N Essentials","source_asin":"B07GRDPHBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GRDPHBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GRDPHBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213614,"name":"Utopia Bedding King Sheet Set - Jersey Knit Sheets 4 Piece King Jersey Sheet Set – Cotton Jersey Sheets – Soft T-Shirt Stretchy Sheets (King, Dark Gre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XOdFRnCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Size & Material: 4 pieces Jersey Sheet Set that includes a fitted sheet measuring 78 by 80 inches with a 15 inches deep pocket, a flat sheet measuring 105 by 102 inches and two pillowcases measuring 20 by 40 inches. The material is Cotton Blend meaning Cotton and Polyester. Cozy & Comfortable: The Jersey Sheets are stretchy, soft, and cozy, just like your favorite T-shirt. You’ll feel extra comfortable while lying down on this jersey sheet and compelled to stay in bed for an extended amount of time. Suitable for all seasons: Our Jersey Sheets are designed significantly for all seasons so that you can experience a pleasant sleep consistently. Attractive Color Range: This sheet comes in a variety of attractive and stylish color ranges to match it up with the overall and bedding and décor of your room. Easy Care: Machine wash in cold water; do not bleach; tumble dry or iron at normal temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XOdFRnCRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Utopia Bedding","source_asin":"B08Y91LQQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213614","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y91LQQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y91LQQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213615,"name":"Shun Reserve ND0720 Hollow-Ground Slicing Knife, 10-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ECnpeWB2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Slicing through meats and vegetables like butter, the Shun Reserve Hollow-Ground Slicing Knife is a warrior in your kitchen-marching steadily through every task you throw at it. The generous 10 inch blade is a must-have when faced with the challenge of larger kitchen prep. The hollow-ground blade helps prevent food from sticking; a real bonus when time is of the essence. Shun Reserve perfectly marries the desire for the ultra-sharp Japanese blade with the weightier feel that Western-style knife lovers prefer. Nothing has been overlooked in the creation of this extraordinary line of kitchen knives-from the weightier blade that provides powerful, precision cutting-to the contoured handles that fit the hand like a glove to provide cutting control; Each knife is a work of art. The blades boasts an incredible ladder Patterned Damascas that is stunning visually, while the dark charcoal PakkaWood handles with red striations dazzle in or out of the knife block. Each feature is chosen for its beauty, as well as its benefit. Shun Reserve knives feature ultra-premium SG2 micro carbide steel cutting core, offering the highest level of performance. SG2 steel has an extremely dense grain structure and purity enabling it to take and hold an exquisitely fine edge with unparalleled durability. Each knife has 32 layers of nickel/stainless Pattern Damascus surrounding the SG2 cutting core for weight, strength and durability. Reserve knives feature full tang, resin-impregnated, riveted PakkaWood handles that offer increased strength. The charcoal PakkaWood handles are unmatched in beauty with the crimson striations and inlaid mosaic Samurai family crest. There is a knife for every job around the kitchen. You’ll appreciate the Reserve’s ultra-sharp cutting edge that you’ve come to expect from Shun knives, while falling in love with the weight and feel that lends itself to traditional Western-style knives. Beauty and innovation-expect nothing less from Shun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ECnpeWB2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shun","source_asin":"B004YG7D6K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213615","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004YG7D6K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004YG7D6K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213616,"name":"All American Collection Doli Sheer Curtains | Two 54\" x 84\" Panels (Lavender)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XFgWd3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enhance your interior design with lightweight Doli sheers from the All American Collection. Each package contains two curtain panels that measure 84 inches in length by 54 inches in width — that's a total of 108\" inches of window coverage per package. The sheer fabric filters natural daylight through your windows while adding rich color that doesn't get washed out. The 1-inch rod pocket offers classic, carefree styling and easy installation — just hang and go! The weave is visually textured with horizontal patterning; dark colors may offer a bit of privacy but are designed to be used as sheers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719XFgWd3HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"All American Collection","source_asin":"B08NH82Z32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NH82Z32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NH82Z32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
