window.products.push({"id":213672,"name":"G&Monday Weighted Blanket Kids (36\" x 48\" 5lbs, Dark Grey), Toddler Weighted Blanket Heavy Blanket with Premium Glass Beads, Cooling Breathable Blanke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713PMOtihsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Natural Sleeping Way】How to get a good night's sleep? G&Monday weighted blanket offers a natural way to relax your body, which wrap and calm your body with enough weight to bring you the feeling of embrace and safety to make you sleep until morning. Just enjoy soft touch while you are resting, reading, working, watching TV or meditating. 【Soft & Premium Material】 This heavy blanket is made of high quality, soft breathable microfiber material and filled with premium glass beads, which could providing a cooling sensation in the summer & a breathable warmth in the winter for maximum comfort and relaxation. 【Professional 7-Layers Design】Unique 7 layer design fits the shape of your body for maximum comfort. 4\"x4\" small enough compartments locked bead to prevents leaking of beads. It has the high-strength stitching to makes the beads evenly distributed in the blanket all the time for the best breathability. 【About Size】 We suggest you choose a weighted blanket that weighs 8%~12% of your body weight. This weighted blanket is much smaller than an ordinary blanket. Please refer to our size chart to choose. Note: the size of the blanket is the size of the blanket, not the bed. 【Prefect Gift Choice】 Whether men or women, children, Weighted blanket is good for everyone. It is also a great gift idea for any holiday, such as birthday, Christmas, Valentine's Day, special anniversaries, Father's Day, Mother's Day, etc. So just choose a good weighted blanket for your family members or friends, then enjoy your happy time! We believe you will love G&Monday.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713PMOtihsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"G&Monday","source_asin":"B0BSD6YWJT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213672","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSD6YWJT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSD6YWJT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
