window.products.push({"id":213674,"name":"Ambesonne Asian Shower Curtain, Bird Cedar Panda Bear Traditional Japanese Painting Style Art Hieroglyph Way, Cloth Fabric Bathroom Decor Set with Hoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-QNqPRTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your purchase will help victims of recent major earthquakes in Turkey since we donate a percentage of our profits to local NGOs helping with quake relief efforts. Measurements - 69” wide x 75” long. No liner needed. 12 hooks included. Made in Turkey. Made from - High quality %100 polyester Turkish fabric material. Water resistant. Non-vinyl. Non-PEVA. Easy to use - Machine washable and dries fast. Features vibrant colors and clear image. No fading. Adds great perspective - Bold graphics printed with state of the art digital printing technology. Designer artwork - Not a common usual shower curtain you can find anywhere. Unique. Genuine. Fun.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-QNqPRTdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ambesonne","source_asin":"B08174SYLL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213674","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08174SYLL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08174SYLL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213675,"name":"Grounding Blanket for Improved Sleep, Pain Relief, Energy, Inflammation. Grounded Throw Blanket Earth Connected Bedding. Cotton and Conductive Silver ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ebeOIFesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌎PREMIUM MATERIALS: The Hooga Grounding Blanket has an interior lining that is a polyester / cotton blend interlaced with conductive silver fiber and an exterior composition of soft and fuzzy, 100% polyester. This grounding blanket measures 60'' x 80\" and comes with a 15 foot grounding cord to connect to a grounded outlet. 👣HOW IT WORKS: Grounding uses the earth's natural energy to improve health and well-being. The earth carries a slightly negative electrical charge. When you come into direct contact with the earth, either by standing barefoot or by using the Hooga Grounding Blanket, this charge is transferred to your body. In your body, these negatively charged free electrons work as antioxidants which neutralize the harmful free radicals and helps you to realize many health benefits. 🌎SET UP: Just attach the snap-on cord to the grounding blanket and insert the prong at the other end of the cord into the ground port on a standard electrical outlet. This will allow the slight negative electrical charge from the earth to flow through the cord and onto the conductive silver thread lining of the interior of the blanket so you can enjoy the benefits of grounding while relaxing at the same time! 👣WHERE TO USE: Use the Hooga Grounding blanket as your preferred blanket while relaxing on the couch, sleeping in bed, or by just putting on the floor to rest your feet on. Regardless how you decide to use the Hooga Blanket you will enjoy the benefits of grounding all while in the comfort of your own home. 🌎HOW TO TEST: For an instructional video demonstration on how to test for continuity as well as do a body voltage test using the grounding mat, please see the video in the side bar underneath the product photos. These tests clearly demonstrate that Hooga grounding products are extremely effective at grounding the body.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ebeOIFesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"hooga","source_asin":"B0BP8F18NM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP8F18NM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP8F18NM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213676,"name":"Delta Children Bistro Kids Play Table with 2-Piece Chair Set | White with Driftwood | Ideal for Arts & Crafts, Snack Time, Homeschooling, Homework & M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MzvhxE04L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The perfect foundation for fun and learning, the Bistro Kids Play Table & Chair Set from Delta Children features a mixed material construction of metal and wood that is sure to inspire hours of imaginative play. Whether your child uses it for art projects, tea parties, snack time or homework, this kids play table & chair set will enhance their sense of wonder no matter what activity they use it for. Sized just right for your growing child - the generous 20\" height of this sturdy play table and 11.25\" seat height ensures it can be used for many years. The table's fun mixed material construction will complement existing bedroom, playroom or living room decor, easily allowing you to create a space that works for kids and adults alike. Rubber feet on the table's and chairs' legs protect the floor from scratches. Recommended for ages 3+. Add the matching Bistro 2-Piece Chair Set for a coordinated look. Delta Children was founded around the idea of making safe, high-quality children's furniture affordable for all families. They know there's nothing more important than safety when it comes to your child's space. That's why all Delta Children products are built with long-lasting materials to ensure they stand up to years of jumping and playing. Plus, they are rigorously tested to meet or exceed all industry safety standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MzvhxE04L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Delta Children","source_asin":"B07KPPJ8N5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213676","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPPJ8N5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPPJ8N5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213677,"name":"CANDWAX Assorted Candles Pillar - Set of 3 Rustic Pillar Candles Includes 3\", 4\" and 8\" Unscented Candles - Long Burning Candles Ideal as Wedding Cand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51REOvYW27L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Candles Features - CANDWAX candle set has 3 pillar candles of various sizes (3x3 pillar candles, 3x4 pillar candles and 3x8 pillar candles) and an incredible burning time of 40, 55 and 90 hours respectively! To make such slow burning candles we use high-quality wax, 100% natural cotton wicks and hundred variations to test. We try to do our best while creating white pillar candles smokeless. We also do not paint our tall candles, you will see that they are solidly colored all the way through. Handmade by Masters of Craft - Our masters are professional craftsmen who carry secrets and traditions of long burning candles making. That's why our white candles pillar are adorable. We choose not to use any fragrance and odors in our wax candles - we believe unscented pillar candles would suit for the most. We've made a wide range of candles bulk so you can choose. We tried to include the most popular colors in our collection! Choose what suits you best! Essential Piece of Decor - Whether you're looking for fireplace decorations for living room, or wedding decorations for ceremony, or you want just white dripless candles for your home - our table candles could fulfill all these needs! Slow burning candles would highlight each special moment of your life with warmth and amenity. Besides mentioned bulk candles are smokeless and fragrance free so you can use it in the presence of people with allergies. How to Use - We recommend using our unscented candle with plate, candle holders, or candle centerpiece to get the best experience. Although you could use them without any candlesticks. Also, our large pillar candles could be impaled on candlesticks with a spike. You could use CANDWAX as lanterns decorative farmhouse - they could be burned outdoor. But please remember that wind or drafts will cause the wick to bend and in this case the white pillar candle will drip! Occasions to Use - Pillar candles bulk could be used on any occasion. Suit ideal as a wedding candle. Whether you are looking for romantic candles, want dinner candles or want to make a cozy atmosphere with decorative pillar candles - CANDWAX pillar candles set would suit you perfectly. White unscented candles won't distract you and won't ruin your mood with strong unpleasant odors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51REOvYW27L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANDWAX","source_asin":"B09P1RFPCG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213677","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P1RFPCG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P1RFPCG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
