window.products.push({"id":213731,"name":"Portable Air Conditioner, 4-IN-1 Evaporative Air Cooler, with 4 Modes 3 Speeds, 1-7H Timer and Negative Ion Function, Portable Air Cooler with 1.35 Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w6cERVeuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【4-IN-1 Function Make You Impeccable】Advanced cooling technology, equipped with an industry-leading honeycomb cascade system, use with ice crystals that transmits hot air over ice water to distribute the cold air throughout the room quickly. In addition to cooling the air quickly, our air coolers also have humidification, negative ions and fan functions. Turning on the negative ion function can release 3.5 million negative ions to freshen the air, circulates air circulation. ❄【Sleep Mode & Timer & Remote Control】3 modes of normal, natural and sleep mode for your choice with this standing air cooler. Sleep soundly throughout the night without waking up in a sweaty mess. Set the 1-7hrs timer function, no worry about being cold at night. The minimum wind speed is 50 db which does not disturb your rest. And remote control offers you totally peace and enjoy without getting up from bed, we consider for you with everything you need. ❄【Ultra-quiet and Safe Design】 Air cooler should never be an annoying good. The noise of this cooler is as low as 50 decibels, which is considered whisper-quiet. Sweet dreams and peaceful work can be achieved with the help of it. Fan blades can be closed manually to effectively prevent the danger of children’s cute finger inserting, and the machine will automatically beep when the water in the water tank has dried up, all of which are designed to provide a safe and cool environment for you. ❄【Top Refilling & Large 5L Water Tank & 4 Ice Packs】Tired of bending over and adding water frequently? Our portable air conditioning fan is designed with easy top refilling which is friendly to the elder and disable person, what’s more, the 5L water Tank allows this evaporative cooler run up to 21H after full refill. This personal air cooler also comes with extra 4 Ice packs which could deliver continuous cooling repeatably. A drainage holes for easy cleaning of the water tank. ❄【360° Universal Wheels & 90° Oscillation】Do you need a portable AC cooler which is easy to remove in rooms, well, our air cooler for room is the perfect choice. Comes with 4 universal wheels which allows you easily take it to any rooms, no extra installation needed, plug and play. The inner blades are designed with 90° swing automatically to cool down your room evenly. Moreover, you can manually adjust the blowing direction vertically in 120° freely. ❄【A Real Lifesaver for Energy and Bill 】Portable Air Conditioner working power is only 65W, will offer several benefits over air conditioner: lower installation and maintenance costs, up to 75% less electricity usage to reduce your bills, no ozone damaging refrigerants, and adds moisture to air-reducing dry air symptoms such as itchy eyes, throat, or skin in dry climates. The treatment of Freon-free is good for protecting the atmosphere and improving our living environment. ❄【Warm Note】Please make sure the blades are manually opened before you turn on the fan. ( tear off the protective film on two sides and manually open the blades by pull one of them up). Make sure the water is refilling till it's above the MIN mark(the water line) at the bottom of the machine. It will start to pump water and go down through the top tank, then it realize a cooling off affect when you choose COOL mode. Please notice that: This machine DOESN'T MIST under COOL mode.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w6cERVeuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Uvistare","source_asin":"B09SLRCYRJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SLRCYRJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SLRCYRJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
