window.products.push({"id":213804,"name":"Dansk Rondure 5Pc Place Setting, 5 Piece, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lNxMqvlQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description This unique flatware design makes a stylistic statement that begs a response. The Rondure 5-piece Place Setting exhibits an unique and intriguing approach to modern design in radiant 18/10 stainless steel, and includes a dinner fork, dinner knife, salad fork, tablespoon, and teaspoon. Amazon.com Sleek, modern, and understatedly witty, the Rondure pattern from Dansk has a distinctive look that is equal parts inviting and innovative. Crafted from 18/10 stainless steel for tarnish-resistance and luster, the design combines circular and curved working ends with lean, angular handles. The knives in the line are especially unique, thanks to their distinctive balance and sinuous curves reminiscent of a sea creature. Ideal for stylish everyday dining, Rondure is also special enough for more upscale occasions. Building block of a Rondure collection, this 5-piece place setting includes a salad fork, a dinner fork, a dinner knife, a soupspoon, and a teaspoon. All pieces are pleasantly weighty in the hand, while their attenuated proportions keep them maneuverable. Finished to a mirror gleam, the set is safe in the dishwasher and never needs polishing. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 1 place setting. Place setting consists of: dinner fork; salad fork; soupspoon; knife; teaspoon. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lNxMqvlQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dansk","source_asin":"B0185RQPRG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213804","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0185RQPRG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0185RQPRG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213805,"name":"FrontTech Mesh Shower Tote Caddy, Shower Tote Bag with 8 Pockets, Quick Dry Bath Organizer, Perfect for Dorm, Gym, Camp and Travel Tote Bag, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ipLFSY9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"To our distinguished potential Customer: Why choose our product?  1 Good design The shower basket helps keep things organized and separated.  2 Sturdy  3 Great to use in the bathroom because you can see and get to everything very easily 4 Easy to carry 5 It stays clean for a super long time, dries quickly   About the product  This shower tote has a large main pocket and 8 ample side pockets, to hold all your bathroom accessories: shampoo, conditioner, soaps, comb, toothbrush, razor.  High quality oxford mesh shower caddy dose not collect water and dries quick.  100% machine washable and rustproof. Sturdy and durable good for several years of daily use.  Designed with convenient and sturdy double woven carrying handle are perfect for the college, dorm, swimmers, gym members, campers, travelers, RVers, mariners, cruisers, and a quick overnight.  Package includes: 1x Shower tote bag Warm Notice: Due to PVC material and long storage time in the Amazon warehouse and long-term transportation, the shower bag may have a slight smell when it is just opened. Please don't worry, just need to air dry it in a ventilated place for 1-2 days, the smell will naturally dissipate. The netted shower caddy has passed the national security department and customs inspection. It is safe to use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ipLFSY9qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FrontTech","source_asin":"B01M9FGE1J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M9FGE1J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M9FGE1J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":213806,"name":"Lifefactory 9-Ounce BPA-Free Kids Glass Water Bottle with Flat Cap and Circle Patterned Silicone Sleeve, Royal Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QV7yFNM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lifefactory 9-ounce (250 ml) reusable glass water bottles are perfect for kids’ lunchboxes and lightweight on-the-go hydration. The compact bottle comes with a leakproof lid and fits easily into handbags, backpacks, and car cup holders. Providing an excellent alternative to disposable plastic bottles, these innovative bottles feature durable glass construction that offers pure taste. The bottle’s glass is surrounded in a patented silicone sleeve that both protects against breakage and provides a comfortable, non-slip gripping surface. For easy care, the silicone sleeve and bottle can be washed together. All components of the bottle are dishwasher safe. It is recommended to wash the cap on the top rack. The cap is constructed of BPA/BPS-free polypropylene (PP#5) with no phthalates, PVC, or polycarbonates. All Lifefactory components are made in the USA or Europe and all products are assembled in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QV7yFNM2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lifefactory","source_asin":"B004797P3A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-213806","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004797P3A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004797P3A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
